  "prefLabel": "Env-A 202.08 Appeals",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 202.08 Appeals. Any person aggrieved by the department’s decision may appeal the decision to the air resources council in accordance with RSA 21-O:14 and Env-AC 200.\n\nSource. #10187, eff 9-25-12 (from Env-A 202.07); ss by #13491, eff 11-19-22",
